{"id": "34911", "title": "不能说的秘密", "author": "周杰伦", "category": "文学名著", "count": 20, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34911/34911s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34911.htm", "intro": "叶湘伦拥有非凡的音乐才华，从小与父亲相依为命。在转读淡江艺术中学的第一天，小伦跟随同学晴依参观学校，却被旧琴房传来的一段钢琴曲深深吸引--他遇到清秀俏皮的女孩路小雨，纯纯的爱情故事开始了。然而，小雨因为误会小伦与晴依在交往，突然消失后就再也没有回来。小伦到处打听，几近绝望的时候，意外发现一张父亲和小雨的合照--二十年前似乎隐藏着“不能说的秘密”……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34911", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2310222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2310223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2310224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2310225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2310226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2310227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2310228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2310229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2310230.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2310231.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2310232.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2310233.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2310234.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2310235.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2310236.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2310237.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2310238.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2310239.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2310240.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2310241.html", "available": true}]}